    "description": "<p>Objective</p><p>Give Deals a human-readable label instead of an auto-number.</p><p>Implementation Requirements</p><ul><li><p>Formula field combining Operator + Partner + Market + Vertical, hyperlinked to the Deal record</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>KEEP the auto-number as Deal Name for uniqueness</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Display BOTH the Deal ID and the combo label</p></li></ul><p>Acceptance Criteria</p><ul><li><p>Label renders and links correctly on Deal and on related lists</p></li></ul><p>Additional Notes</p><p>Known trade-off, already accepted: a formula hyperlink has no hover preview.</p><p>Related: BUILD-41 creates Deal Name / Partner Name Search Key text fields, since Console search cannot read formula fields.</p><p>Estimate: XS · ~2h</p><p>Source: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 37. Also raised in build notes 2026-07-20.</p>",
