    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "10312",
          "body": "<p>Hi <a href=\"https://app.asana.com/1/1202721605677544/profile/1203115293332591\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</a> I created the hyperlink formula field on Deal.</p><p>But I think it will be more user friendly if we create a flow to always update the Deal name to the format (Operator + Partner + Market + Vertical).</p><p>We can create a separate autonumber for uniqueness. </p>",
          "created": "2026-08-05T11:49:52.332-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-05T11:49:52.332-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "10313",
          "body": "<p>Updated List View</p>",
          "created": "2026-08-05T12:52:42.771-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-05T12:52:42.771-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "10314",
          "body": "<p>Agreed with your approach <a href=\"https://app.asana.com/1/1202721605677544/profile/1211293891951374\">@Marc Jester Cabantog</a>, let&#039;s use the OOTB Name field that we can set via flow (on create and update) and still have a separate auto-numbered field for the Deal Number</p><p>For the Name formula use the following: </p><p>Requested format for the Deal Name:</p><ul><li><p>With state: {StateCode}<s>{OperatorName}</s>{vertical}</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>No state: {CountryCode}<s>{OperatorName}</s>{vertical} </p></li></ul><ul><li><p>ALL CAPS; strip spaces and apostrophes from names. No emojis (for now, may add this back later) </p></li></ul><p>-State Code and Country Code should be resolved from the Market State and Market Country fields (whatever method works best)</p>",
          "created": "2026-08-10T15:38:09.664-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-10T15:38:09.664-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "10315",
          "body": "<p>Heads up I created a bunch of new fields to support the short code: </p>",
          "created": "2026-08-10T22:58:55.941-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-10T22:58:55.941-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "10316",
          "body": "<p>Deal Format</p><p>IF(</p><p>ISBLANK(TEXT({!$Record.Market_State__c})), </p><p>UPPER(IF({</p><figure data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"center\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"UNKNOWN_MEDIA_$Record.Market_Country_Code__c} = &#039;US &amp; CA&#039;, &#039;USCA&#039;, {\" data-width=\"200\" data-height=\"183\"></div></figure><p>$Record.Market_Country_Code_<em>c})+ &#039;-&#039; + {!$Record.Operatorr.Name} + &#039;-&#039; +{!$Record.Partnerr.Partner_Codec}+ &#039;-&#039;+ TEXT({!$Record.Vertical</em>_c})), </p><p>UPPER({</p><figure data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"center\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"UNKNOWN_MEDIA_$Record.Market_State_Code__c} + &#039;-&#039; + {\" data-width=\"200\" data-height=\"183\"></div></figure><p>$Record.Operator_<em>r.Name} + &#039;-&#039; +{!$Record.Partnerr.Partner_Codec}+ &#039;-&#039;+ TEXT({!$Record.Vertical</em>_c}))</p><p>)</p>",
          "created": "2026-08-11T14:54:54.995-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-11T14:54:54.995-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        }
      ],
